          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h1 id=\"apb_studio-corpus-kanban\">apb_studio \u2014 corpus kanban</h1>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">A dataset flows left\u2192right through the baskets; the basket it sits in is the furthest stage it\nhas reached. <strong>Run</strong> a basket to advance the selected rows to the next stage; <strong>Clean</strong> drops them\nback one basket. Select rows one-by-one, or use the table's search + header checkbox to grab all\nof a software/module at once. Hit <strong>\u21bb reload</strong> after a run finishes to see rows move.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
